WEBVTT

00:10.540 --> 00:12.080
Director?

00:15.120 --> 00:17.620
Aw, she's not here.

00:36.320 --> 00:41.650
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

00:36.320 --> 00:41.650
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

00:41.650 --> 00:46.150
Seven colours are not enough

00:41.650 --> 00:46.150
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

00:46.150 --> 00:51.820
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

00:46.150 --> 00:49.150
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

00:49.150 --> 00:51.820
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

00:51.820 --> 00:57.820
The story is going beyond

00:51.820 --> 00:57.820
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

01:01.990 --> 01:07.320
The bell toll in my heart

01:01.990 --> 01:07.320
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

01:07.320 --> 01:11.650
is getting louder bit by bit

01:07.320 --> 01:11.650
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

01:11.650 --> 01:15.150
Believe in the excitement

01:11.650 --> 01:15.150
sono takanari wo shinjite

01:15.150 --> 01:17.650
And take one step forward

01:15.150 --> 01:17.650
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

01:17.650 --> 01:24.980
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

01:17.650 --> 01:24.980
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

01:23.320 --> 01:25.980
Can't be for sure

01:23.320 --> 01:25.980
zettai nante nai

01:24.980 --> 01:27.650
Nothing

01:24.980 --> 01:27.650
nanimo

01:25.980 --> 01:28.650
There's no guarantee

01:25.980 --> 01:28.650
kakushin wa dekinai

01:27.650 --> 01:30.320
No one

01:27.650 --> 01:30.320
daremo

01:28.650 --> 01:31.320
But I won't give up

01:28.650 --> 01:31.320
demo akiramenai

01:30.320 --> 01:32.980
That's why

01:30.320 --> 01:32.980
dakara

01:31.320 --> 01:33.480
I can still move forward

01:31.320 --> 01:33.480
susundeku koto ga

01:33.310 --> 01:34.820
I can still move forward

01:33.310 --> 01:34.820
dekiru yo

01:34.820 --> 01:40.650
Because there's magic right in here

01:34.820 --> 01:40.650
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

01:40.650 --> 01:46.980
It started to be brighter than the stars

01:40.650 --> 01:46.980
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

01:46.980 --> 01:51.650
I can't stop now

01:46.980 --> 01:51.650
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

01:51.650 --> 01:57.320
It entered into a new era

01:51.650 --> 01:57.320
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

01:57.320 --> 02:01.650
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

01:57.320 --> 02:01.650
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

02:01.650 --> 02:05.320
And go beyond the future

02:01.650 --> 02:05.320
saki no hou e

02:11.620 --> 02:13.410
Are you okay, Lyn-chan?

02:15.290 --> 02:18.660
You should breathe in through
your nose and breathe out of your mouth.

02:22.660 --> 02:24.790
You breathed in too much!

02:24.790 --> 02:26.410
Do we still have a ways to go?

02:26.410 --> 02:30.370
Hmm... Just a bit further, I think.

02:30.370 --> 02:35.370
I hate to ask... but your sense
of direction is fine, right?

02:35.370 --> 02:37.160
Huh? I dunno.

02:38.500 --> 02:40.120
Mary!

02:40.120 --> 02:42.830
Where are you, Mary?!

02:44.790 --> 02:48.160
Say something if you can hear us!

02:49.200 --> 02:50.410
What's wrong?

02:50.410 --> 02:51.660
Tiara?!

02:51.660 --> 02:53.080
What are you doing here?

02:53.080 --> 02:56.500
We got the summons from Lucifer and—

02:54.250 --> 02:56.500
Have you seen Mary?!

02:56.500 --> 02:58.200
What happened?

02:58.200 --> 03:01.370
We haven't seen her since this morning.

03:01.370 --> 03:04.370
We haven't seen her.

03:04.370 --> 03:07.200
I wonder if she got lost.

03:07.200 --> 03:09.120
You don't know where she could've gone?

03:11.410 --> 03:13.450
Mary!

03:13.450 --> 03:15.910
Where art thou?

03:15.910 --> 03:19.290
We all split up and have been looking for her.

03:19.290 --> 03:22.120
If she's hurt somewhere...

03:25.410 --> 03:27.040
We'll help, too.

03:27.040 --> 03:29.790
Yeah. The more the better.

03:29.790 --> 03:32.870
It'll be nothing but rough sailing from here!

03:32.870 --> 03:34.500
Thanks...

03:34.500 --> 03:36.370
Rose, you take care of Lynette.

03:36.370 --> 03:37.620
All right.

03:37.620 --> 03:39.330
I'm sorry...

03:39.330 --> 03:41.910
Here, I'll lead you to our tent.

03:41.910 --> 03:43.160
Thanks.

03:50.290 --> 03:54.750
It's rather peculiar that even
Salsa-sama can't track her scent.

03:56.000 --> 03:58.330
Her scent just disappeared.

03:58.330 --> 04:00.540
Did she get kidnapped
by an eagle, or something?

04:01.830 --> 04:06.330
I'm not certain, but perhaps this has to do
with the supernatural phenomena.

04:06.330 --> 04:07.040
Huh?!

04:07.040 --> 04:11.660
There have rare been cases in forests
and mountains where people are taken

04:11.660 --> 04:13.620
and people believe that it might've been

04:13.620 --> 04:16.450
the work of spirits such as fairies or <i>rusalki</i>.

04:16.450 --> 04:18.000
Such nonsense.

04:20.080 --> 04:23.450
So, uh... What happens to those people?

04:23.450 --> 04:24.950
According to rumours...

04:24.950 --> 04:28.290
Their personalities completely change,
they don't remember the incident at all,

04:28.290 --> 04:32.160
or they were just playing at someone's house.
There's no solid answer.

04:34.120 --> 04:35.950
Playing at someone's house?

04:38.040 --> 04:40.120
My, my...

04:40.120 --> 04:42.910
What a lovely mountain cottage.

04:46.330 --> 04:47.830
The doors...

04:48.830 --> 04:51.330
They were closed yesterday.

04:51.330 --> 04:52.830
Well, we should probably head in.

04:52.830 --> 04:55.000
What?! We're going in?!

04:55.000 --> 04:58.620
Could it be... that you're scared?

04:58.620 --> 05:02.250
Sca— Of course, I'm not scared!

05:22.120 --> 05:26.190
I don't sense anyone's presence.
I knew it. It must be—

05:26.190 --> 05:27.160
Huh?!

05:27.160 --> 05:29.290
Wait, what's going on?!

05:32.870 --> 05:35.790
To think that even your brute strength
isn't enough to open them...

05:35.790 --> 05:37.660
Who are you calling a brute?!

05:37.660 --> 05:39.700
Well, let us proceed.

05:39.700 --> 05:42.830
Huh? Alpha, wait!

05:42.830 --> 05:44.790
I told you to wait!

05:56.790 --> 05:58.040
Mary!

05:58.040 --> 05:59.160
Hey!

05:59.160 --> 06:01.450
If you can hear us, answer us!

06:01.450 --> 06:04.540
My sisters are looking around here.

06:04.540 --> 06:07.370
Then I'll search around this valley...

06:10.700 --> 06:13.410
You can get some rest here.

06:13.410 --> 06:16.120
I'm really sorry about this.

06:16.120 --> 06:18.620
We need to look out for each other.

06:18.620 --> 06:22.750
"Witches, be the light for
thy neighbour," and such.

06:22.750 --> 06:24.410
That's...

06:24.410 --> 06:26.120
One of Ray's best lines.

06:26.120 --> 06:28.040
I'm a huge fan.

06:28.040 --> 06:31.910
Me, too. I was so moved
after seeing their Orchestra.

06:31.910 --> 06:34.290
No unit could possibly surpass Ray!

06:34.290 --> 06:36.540
Ah, I see you're a lady of culture, as well.

06:36.540 --> 06:38.870
Let's chat about them when we have more time.

06:38.870 --> 06:40.950
Yes!

06:40.950 --> 06:44.290
First, we need to find Mary!

06:57.250 --> 07:01.080
How strange... Did this cottage
always seem this big?

07:01.080 --> 07:03.620
This space has been warped.

07:03.620 --> 07:05.660
What do you mean, Alpha?!

07:08.370 --> 07:10.580
You called, I appeared, and...

07:12.200 --> 07:14.620
Don't scare me like that!

07:14.620 --> 07:16.950
I was trying to calm your nerves.

07:19.790 --> 07:21.500
What in the world is this?

07:21.500 --> 07:23.290
It's so rundown.

07:23.290 --> 07:25.910
There's something really eerie about it.

07:25.910 --> 07:27.250
Yeah...

07:31.700 --> 07:33.290
This is Mary's!

07:33.290 --> 07:36.700
Huh?! Does that mean...

07:36.700 --> 07:38.290
She's inside?

07:39.790 --> 07:40.830
Mary!

07:40.830 --> 07:42.410
Champe!

07:42.410 --> 07:45.660
I'll go with her,
so you two go tell everyone else!

07:45.660 --> 07:46.910
Okie-dokie!

07:46.910 --> 07:48.330
Roger.

07:51.830 --> 07:53.250
Wait, Champe!

07:58.540 --> 08:01.450
Mary!

08:15.790 --> 08:18.290
Let's stay calm and look for her. Okay?

08:22.330 --> 08:26.370
Thanks for worrying about me. I'm fine.

08:33.160 --> 08:36.910
Rip, rip, shattering

08:36.910 --> 08:40.200
So soft, it's almost scary

08:40.200 --> 08:43.830
My honest feelings come pouring out of me

08:44.000 --> 08:45.450
You're really good.

08:45.450 --> 08:48.620
We need a little pick me up at times like this.

08:48.620 --> 08:52.540
And our Orchestra's coming up,
so I have to practice.

08:52.540 --> 08:54.120
Your Orchestra?

08:54.120 --> 08:58.120
I'm in a unit called Sugar Pockets!
I hope you'll come see us!

08:58.120 --> 09:01.080
Of course. I'll be there.

09:01.080 --> 09:03.410
Are you in a unit with the other two?

09:05.370 --> 09:12.750
Just Ratura. We want Mary to join,
but she's so shy...

09:12.750 --> 09:18.370
I see... Well, I hope you get
to perform together someday.

09:20.330 --> 09:21.540
Yeah.

09:25.120 --> 09:26.910
Say, Ashley.

09:27.790 --> 09:29.880
What is it, Lavie?

09:30.200 --> 09:32.620
Where's everyone else?

09:33.700 --> 09:35.700
I haven't the slightest.

09:58.000 --> 10:01.120
Mary wouldn't be in a place
like this, would she?

10:01.120 --> 10:04.500
Why are you going this far
out of your way, my lady?

10:06.700 --> 10:08.500
Isn't it obvious?

10:08.500 --> 10:11.750
So she's important to you?

10:11.750 --> 10:17.500
I wouldn't say that, but we
should all help each other out.

10:17.500 --> 10:22.790
So right now, I'm doing everything
that I can possibly do.

10:22.790 --> 10:26.080
I see. This must be what you call chivalry.

10:26.080 --> 10:27.540
That's not exactly it, either...

10:28.870 --> 10:31.830
Oh? Is something the matter?

10:31.830 --> 10:36.370
What? You can't hear that?!

10:52.000 --> 10:56.410
That crying... That has nothing
to do with Maryberry, right?

10:56.410 --> 10:58.540
I don't think so...

11:01.410 --> 11:03.290
I think it's that room.

11:26.450 --> 11:28.040
This must be it.

11:39.080 --> 11:40.200
It stopped?

11:40.200 --> 11:41.580
It appears so.

11:58.830 --> 12:03.750
Honestly, what's going on?
It's not like ghosts exist.

12:05.370 --> 12:06.700
But they do.

12:08.000 --> 12:11.620
I mean, look behind you, my lady.

12:20.660 --> 12:22.870
What was that...?

12:22.870 --> 12:25.080
My heart went a pitter-patter
and a thump-thump.

12:25.080 --> 12:27.620
This isn't the time to joke around!

12:27.620 --> 12:29.450
Yes, but that was a ghost...

12:29.450 --> 12:30.910
Huh? Emilia?

12:34.000 --> 12:35.660
It's Tiara-sama.

12:35.660 --> 12:38.000
What a coincidence, seeing you here.

12:40.080 --> 12:42.040
What happened to Emilia?

12:42.040 --> 12:43.790
No need to worry.

12:50.330 --> 12:53.290
Huh? You're here, too, Alpha?

12:53.290 --> 12:59.750
I got to see my lady's cute side,
so we should probably call it a night.

12:59.750 --> 13:02.160
That itself is another form of chivalry.

13:10.500 --> 13:13.950
Are you not affected because
you're an Enchanted Doll?

13:13.950 --> 13:15.700
Affected by?

13:15.700 --> 13:17.700
Even if you touch Emilia...

13:17.700 --> 13:22.830
Salsa-sama and I are demihumans.
Energy Drain has no effect on us.

13:24.080 --> 13:25.700
I see...

13:33.330 --> 13:34.620
This is...

13:34.620 --> 13:36.700
The entrance we came through.

13:36.700 --> 13:39.040
We're back at the start.

13:45.910 --> 13:47.200
Alpha?

13:47.200 --> 13:49.950
Is there something wrong with that doll?

13:55.580 --> 13:57.450
Hey! Wait!

13:57.450 --> 13:58.700
It talked?!

13:58.700 --> 13:59.870
Damn it!

14:10.790 --> 14:12.290
We're saved...

14:12.290 --> 14:14.700
It appears that you must be punished.

14:14.700 --> 14:17.950
Wait, wait, wait! My bad! I'm sorry!

14:17.950 --> 14:19.830
So please?

14:19.830 --> 14:21.330
She did this?

14:21.330 --> 14:22.500
Yes.

14:22.500 --> 14:25.910
Then Mary... Do you know where Mary is?!

14:25.910 --> 14:28.080
Mary? Who's that?

14:28.080 --> 14:29.660
Well, let's split her legs open.

14:30.910 --> 14:33.660
I finally caught up with you.

14:33.660 --> 14:37.410
Excuse me... Did Marianne-san
do something rude?

14:37.410 --> 14:40.120
Looks like the star has arrived.

14:40.120 --> 14:42.580
She goes to our school?

14:42.580 --> 14:45.580
I apologize for scaring you earlier.

14:45.580 --> 14:50.250
I was just trying to greet you,
but I probably got too excited.

14:56.290 --> 14:57.700
Champe?

14:59.040 --> 15:00.290
Mary?!

15:00.290 --> 15:01.950
What are you doing here?

15:01.950 --> 15:04.580
Mary!

15:08.450 --> 15:13.910
Oh, so Mary's that little shrimp.
Why didn't you just say so—

15:13.910 --> 15:15.290
Silence.

15:16.830 --> 15:21.660
Wait... Did I make you all worry?

15:21.660 --> 15:23.080
Of course, you did!

15:25.330 --> 15:27.830
But I'm so glad you're safe.

15:29.830 --> 15:32.080
I'm sorry...

15:32.080 --> 15:35.120
Maryberry-san, are these your...

15:35.120 --> 15:37.370
Yes, we're her friends.

15:37.370 --> 15:39.910
Ah, so these are friends...

15:39.910 --> 15:42.290
So, what's she doing here?

15:42.290 --> 15:44.660
Oh, well...

15:46.910 --> 15:50.580
I met her by the river last night.

15:50.580 --> 15:52.950
She suddenly passed out,
so I took her home with me...

15:52.950 --> 15:56.910
Er, I decided to take her back to care for her.

15:58.200 --> 16:04.080
We were enjoying some tea
when all of you arrived.

16:04.080 --> 16:08.200
I was scared at first, but she took care of me.

16:08.200 --> 16:11.040
Thank you, um...

16:12.290 --> 16:16.120
My name is Garnet.

16:16.120 --> 16:17.410
Thank you, Garnet-san.

16:18.750 --> 16:21.330
Tiara, Alpha, thank you, too.

16:21.330 --> 16:23.830
And Emilia.

16:23.830 --> 16:26.580
Everyone's worried, so let's head back.

16:26.580 --> 16:27.580
Okay.

16:27.580 --> 16:29.580
Maryberry-san.

16:29.580 --> 16:31.790
About what we talked about earlier...

16:31.790 --> 16:37.200
I believe that you must speak your feelings,
or they won't be heard.

16:37.200 --> 16:42.250
Marianne-san has also told me that
failure leads to success before.

16:42.250 --> 16:44.040
So please, do your best.

16:44.040 --> 16:46.330
I will also do my best.

16:49.370 --> 16:50.500
Okay!

16:50.500 --> 16:51.910
I'll do my best!

16:57.080 --> 17:00.580
I failed to make friends yet again...

17:00.580 --> 17:02.580
Again?

17:02.580 --> 17:08.000
Well, I want to make some friends,
so I invite anyone I encounter to this house,

17:08.000 --> 17:11.370
but everyone always seems to run away...

17:11.370 --> 17:14.000
Well, that's probably because...

17:14.000 --> 17:16.500
Because?

17:16.500 --> 17:18.370
Never mind.

17:18.370 --> 17:20.660
You break your back for nothing.

17:20.660 --> 17:22.660
You appear to have been through a lot,

17:22.660 --> 17:24.410
though you don't seem to have
any bones to break.

17:25.700 --> 17:28.450
You are very kind.

17:28.450 --> 17:32.200
If you're going to possess anyone,
please go to Lady Emilia instead.

17:32.200 --> 17:34.450
She is far kinder than I. By a megaton.

17:36.120 --> 17:40.120
So she'll be my friend?

17:42.790 --> 17:45.540
Good morning, my lady.

17:45.540 --> 17:47.500
Are you all right?

17:47.500 --> 17:49.250
Who is she?!

17:49.250 --> 17:50.750
If you touch me—

17:50.750 --> 17:53.250
She's also a demihuman, so it'll be all right.

17:54.540 --> 17:56.120
Oh, no wonder.

17:56.120 --> 18:00.660
She also appears to want to be
your friend, my lady.

18:00.660 --> 18:05.750
Well, she apparently goes to our school,
so I wouldn't mind being your friend.

18:05.750 --> 18:07.580
Really?!

18:07.580 --> 18:10.580
It's always favourable to find more comrades.

18:10.580 --> 18:12.620
Thank you so much!

18:12.620 --> 18:13.580
So cold!

18:13.580 --> 18:16.750
I have truly witnessed your chivalry, my lady.

18:18.580 --> 18:20.200
Oh, my.

18:20.200 --> 18:25.120
I'm such a scatterbrain.
I forgot to serve you all tea.

18:25.120 --> 18:26.790
I'll go make some right now.

18:28.450 --> 18:29.500
Huh?!

18:29.500 --> 18:31.330
Wait, what just happened?

18:31.330 --> 18:33.160
Is something the matter?

18:33.160 --> 18:36.120
Sh-She just... w-w-went through...

18:36.120 --> 18:38.830
Well, she is a ghost.

18:38.830 --> 18:41.910
But you just said she was a demihuman!

18:41.910 --> 18:45.200
Ghosts are fine demihumans.
Is there a problem?

18:47.500 --> 18:50.120
And you're...

18:50.120 --> 18:52.410
I was born here.

18:52.410 --> 18:55.700
It just talked!

18:53.120 --> 18:55.700
Please quiet down, my lady.

18:55.700 --> 19:00.250
I don't even know how, but one day,
I was able to see and hear.

19:01.700 --> 19:07.580
I used to be surrounded by a bunch of humans,
but eventually, I ended up alone.

19:07.580 --> 19:10.620
That was a long time ago,
so I don't remember it well.

19:11.750 --> 19:15.620
One day, I happened to meet Garnet
who was wandering around.

19:15.620 --> 19:17.500
We're kindred spirits.

19:17.500 --> 19:21.500
I wanted to grant Garnet's wish.

19:21.500 --> 19:25.370
So wait, could the supernatural
phenomena in the summons...

19:25.370 --> 19:28.790
Are probably due to this doll
and Garnet-sama.

19:28.790 --> 19:30.040
But...

19:30.040 --> 19:33.000
It appears you went a bit too far earlier.

19:33.000 --> 19:36.500
Well, uh... You know.

19:36.500 --> 19:40.120
Garnet was busy dealing with
the shri— Maryberry-san earlier,

19:40.120 --> 19:42.500
so I thought I'd have some fun with you guys.

19:50.660 --> 19:53.750
I guess I'll let it slide this once.

19:56.750 --> 20:02.080
Well, if that girl is a ghost...
Who exactly is she?

20:02.080 --> 20:06.500
Garnet only remembers her name.

20:06.500 --> 20:10.370
She doesn't even think
of herself as a ghost.

20:14.540 --> 20:16.620
Sorry to keep you waiting!

20:17.620 --> 20:20.830
Oh, did I scare you again?

20:20.830 --> 20:25.700
My magic that allows me to pass through
walls makes people think I'm a ghost.

20:25.700 --> 20:28.910
I do beg your pardon, but your body
has long departed this world,

20:28.910 --> 20:32.870
so your soul should probably follow sui—
—You stupid Junk Doll!

20:32.870 --> 20:36.450
To suggest I've died like that. You're so funny.

20:36.450 --> 20:41.580
But I'm extremely scared of ghosts,
so don't frighten me too much.

20:44.000 --> 20:45.160
Um...

20:45.160 --> 20:46.790
Don't you dare say it.

20:46.790 --> 20:49.870
All right, everyone. Thank you all for waiting.

20:49.870 --> 20:52.120
Garnet.

20:52.120 --> 20:55.250
You should join our group.

20:55.250 --> 20:56.290
Group?

20:56.290 --> 21:02.000
You mean you're not going to spend
the rest of your lives here with me?

21:02.000 --> 21:05.540
No. Instead, you should re-enrol in the academy.

21:05.540 --> 21:06.390
Academy?

21:06.390 --> 21:07.120
Yes.

21:07.120 --> 21:09.540
You'll be able to make new memories.

21:11.830 --> 21:15.040
And you'll be able to make a lot of friends.

21:17.000 --> 21:19.450
That's quite lovely!

21:20.790 --> 21:22.330
But...

21:22.330 --> 21:26.450
You're the only friend I need, Emilia-san.

21:26.450 --> 21:30.000
Uh, er... I suddenly feel a chill...

21:32.040 --> 21:34.910
I'm so happy to see you so
happy, my lady.

21:34.910 --> 21:36.450
How?!

22:15.630 --> 22:18.940
yamiyo ni ukabeta sapphire

22:15.630 --> 22:18.940
A Sapphire floats in the dark night

22:18.940 --> 22:22.250
nagai matsuge wo yurasu dreamer

22:18.940 --> 22:22.250
Batting long eyelashes, a Dreamer

